        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The colors and patterns on your skin shift naturally to match your mood. This has the same effect as a moodskin augmentation, though it doesn't count as an augmentation. You decide which color corresponds to each emotion when you select this heritage. You don't gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.ancestry-features.Item.Skin Artistry]{skin artistry} ability or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.Shift Skin]{Skin Shift} action.</p>\n<p>In addition, your open and honest manner makes it easy for you to influence others. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus on Diplomacy checks to [[/act make-an-impression]] and [[/act request]] whenever you're feeling a positive emotion (such as happiness or curiosity) and on Intimidation checks to [[/act coerce]] and [[/act demoralize]] whenever you're feeling a negative emotion (such as anger or frustration).</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Starfinder Tech Core"
        },
